  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit tells Fang Yuan that Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s three true inheritances cover all of his luck path methods: self luck, all living being’s luck, and heaven and earth luck. Self luck true inheritance is with Lang Ya; all living being’s luck was inside Imperial Court blessed land; heaven and earth luck is in Longevity Heaven. Lang Ya urges Fang Yuan to take self luck because his luck looks bad, and notes that higher personal luck eases calamities and tribulations even without Gu such as divert disaster Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1051
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable",
        "path_luck",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect",
        "loc_imperial_court_blessed_land",
        "fac_longevity_heaven",
        "gu_divert_disaster_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heaven Extremity later states the same trio in short form: self luck replenishes oneself, all living being’s luck takes others’ surpluses to replenish oneself, and heaven and earth luck takes heaven and earth’s surpluses to replenish oneself.",
      "chapters": [
        1180
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_heaven_extremity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan recalls that Dog Shit Luck is among the key parts of the self luck true inheritance and that he already possesses it.",
      "chapters": [
        1093
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "placement-and-key-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_dog_shit_luck"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Placement remains Lang Ya blessed land, with all living being’s luck in Eighty-Eight True Yang Building and heaven and earth luck in Longevity Heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        1304
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "placement-and-key-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In a trade of inheritances with Lang Ya land spirit, Fang Yuan obtains almost all of Lang Ya Sect’s inheritances, including the complete self luck true inheritance. He had already held a portion of its essence; the trade gives him the complete essence of that one of Giant Sun’s three great true inheritances.",
      "chapters": [
        1447
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "complete-essence",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Researching the inheritance, Fang Yuan treats self luck as the Giant Sun true inheritance that lets him control his own luck. It describes sizes, colors, and shapes of luck and methods to alter them, and Fang Yuan finds it comprehensive beside a short Thieving Heaven true inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        1782
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "own-luck-research",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_thieving_heaven_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Giant Sun’s self luck true inheritance revolves around researching one’s own luck and how to modify it; Cooking Luck Pot is the peak creation within that true inheritance and can cook any form of luck into a form the user wants.",
      "chapters": [
        1824
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "peak-creation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_cooking_luck_pot"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan rates his rank six Cooking Luck Pot as the epitome of Giant Sun’s self luck true inheritance, and notes that the inheritance includes the killer move luck inspection from rank one to nine while his luck inspection Immortal Gu is only rank six.",
      "chapters": [
        1826
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inspection-methods",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_luck_inspection_immortal_gu"
      ]
    }
  ],
